PGCF OpenEBS LVM exporter metadata patch

This image contains OpenEBS LVM LocalPV 1.10.1, source commit
e8a234cbfeef5fa16fde1330c8de2d91e31831f1, licensed under Apache-2.0.
Original copyright notices are retained in the corresponding source archive.

PGCF contributors modified only the exporter collectors and added exporter-specific
metadata readers and regression tests on 2026-10-13. CSI device-path validation
and thin-pool capacity discovery retain the upstream implementation. The upstream
source archive and applied patch accompany this image under /usr/share/pgcf.

The rebuilt binary includes the Go runtime (BSD-3-Clause). Its license and
the vendored dependency notices are retained alongside this notice.
